<title>USA: Valhi Inc unit redeems $27.6 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Valhi Inc unit redeems $27.6 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valcor Inc, a subidiary of Valhi Inc, said Friday holders had tendered about $27.6 million principal amount of its 9.625 percent senior notes due 2003.</p>
<p>The company had previously offered to purchase up to $86.7 million principal amount of the notes for a cash purchase price equal to 100 percent  of the principal amount plus accrued and unpaid interest to the date of purchase.</p>
<p>The offer expired at 1800 EDT/2200 GMT April 24, and was not extended.</p>
</text>
